  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Next generation solar, dissemination workshop with CEO roundtable</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conduct a scoping study to evaluate the feasibility, challenges, and implementation pathways for Agri-Photovoltaic (PV), Floating Solar, and Building-Integrated Photovoltaics (BIPV) solutions within India&#x2019;s food-water-energy nexus. The study will incorporate international best practices, including those from the UK, and identify opportunities for collaboration in R&amp;D, financing mechanisms, and community-level pilot projects to support scalable adoption and sustainable livelihoods.</narrative>
  </description>
